  "description": "KEBRIU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C45 H73 Dy3 N8 O15 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),6(C1 H4 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.499-3.547 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.33-97.14°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy3L(μ3-OH)2(NO3)2(H2O)4]·2NO3·6MeOH·H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
